# Model assignments — Auto default, paid picker, assigned internals

Production **Free** users do not pick a model (Auto only). **Paid** and **Enterprise** users get a global picker that defaults to **Auto**. Auto still means `COOP_FEATURE_MODEL_ASSIGNMENTS`, not a callable model id.

## Source of truth

`src/config/featureModelAssignments.ts` — `COOP_FEATURE_MODEL_ASSIGNMENTS` and `resolveAssignedModelForUseCase()`.

| Feature | Provider | Model | Picker? |
|---|---|---|---|
| Chat | OpenAI | gpt-5-mini | Yes (global) |
| Quick actions + integration chat | Anthropic | claude-sonnet-4-6 | Yes (global) |
| /edit patches | OpenAI | gpt-5.1 | Yes (global) |
| Autocomplete | Mistral | codestral-latest | No — always Auto bucket |
| Intent suggest (chip classifier) | OpenAI | gpt-4o-mini | No |
| Sources expand preview | OpenAI | gpt-4o-mini | No |
| PR notes | OpenAI | gpt-4o-mini | No |

## Required wiring (all must stay connected)

1. **Settings UI** (`SettingsDetailViews.tsx` `ModelDetail`) — static page (not tied to the composer pick). Auto explanation, feature → model list with maker docs links, then picker models grouped by maker with docs links. Autocomplete toggle stays. No picker on this page.
2. **Composer** (`ChatComposer.tsx` + `ModelPickerSelect`) — same picker; hidden on Free.
3. **Extension runtime** — `resolveRuntimeModelForUseCase()` for chat / QA / edit; `resolveRuntimeAutocompleteModel()` always uses the autocomplete assignment unless `devMode`.
4. **Config writes** — `stripUserModelPreferenceUpdates()` allows `llmProvider` / `defaultModel` when `canUserSelectModels` (paid, enterprise, or devMode). Free writes are stripped.
5. **Server enforcement** — `resolveHonoredChatModel` in `chatApi.ts`: Auto / Free / unknown / non-picker use cases → assignment. Paid catalog ids honored. Inline completions stay assigned + Auto bucket.

## Tests

Run `npx tsx src/config/featureModelAssignments.test.ts` and `npm run test:autocomplete` after any change to model routing or Model & chat settings.

## Docs

Keep `website/content/docs/model-assignments.md` in sync with `COOP_FEATURE_MODEL_ASSIGNMENTS`.
